---
import Prose from "../components/Prose.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  theme="light"
  title="About ScientFactory"
  description="ScientFactory is building Scient—an intelligent workspace that brings research tools and AI agents together, with the researcher at the center."
>
  <Prose
    eyebrow="About ScientFactory"
    title="Building a better home for scientific work."
    intro="ScientFactory is building Scient—an intelligent workspace that brings research tools and AI agents together, with the researcher at the center."
  >
    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="about-why">
      <p class="content-section__label">Why Scient</p>
      <div class="content-section__body">
        <h2 id="about-why">Research moves forward. Its context should move with it.</h2>
        <p>
          Scientific work moves between papers, notes, data, figures, and manuscripts. Each stage builds on what came before: a source worth following, a method chosen, a result questioned, a decision made.
        </p>
        <p>
          Moving between tools often means rebuilding that context. We’re building Scient so researchers can carry their sources, work, and decisions through the whole process—from the first question to final publication.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="about-approach">
      <p class="content-section__label">Our approach</p>
      <div class="content-section__body">
        <h2 id="about-approach">Built to support scientific judgment.</h2>
        <p>
          AI can help researchers explore ideas, work through analysis, and develop a manuscript. The researcher’s judgment guides that work. Four principles shape how we build Scient.
        </p>
        <div class="content-grid">
          <article class="content-card">
            <h3>Researcher in control</h3>
            <p>You decide which questions to pursue, which actions to authorize, and what to accept into your work.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="content-card">
            <h3>Connected context</h3>
            <p>Papers, notes, analysis, and writing belong to the same research project. We’re building toward a workspace where each can inform the next.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="content-card">
            <h3>Inspectable work</h3>
            <p>You should be able to see what an agent did, examine the sources and outputs, and correct the work when needed.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="content-card">
            <h3>A continuous workflow</h3>
            <p>Reading a paper, testing an idea, creating a figure, and writing about the result should feel like connected steps. Scient brings those activities into one place.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="about-development">
      <p class="content-section__label">Where we are today</p>
      <div class="content-section__body">
        <h2 id="about-development">Growing through real research.</h2>
        <p>
          Scient is available to download and is under active development. We’re improving it through real use, one reliable workflow at a time.
        </p>
        <p>
          The connected research environment described here is our direction. Its capabilities are still evolving, and the documentation explains how to use what’s available today.
        </p>
        <div class="content-actions about-actions">
          <a class="content-action about-action about-action--primary" href="/download">Download Scient</a>
          <a class="content-action about-action" href="/docs">Read the docs</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </Prose>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-actions .about-action {
    min-height: 2.25rem;
    padding: 0.45rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.25;
    transition: background-color 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease, color 180ms ease;
  }

  .about-actions .about-action--primary {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .about-actions .about-action:hover {
      border-color: #a3a7ad;
      color: var(--ink);
      transform: none;
    }

    .about-actions .about-action--primary:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent-hover);
      background: var(--accent-hover);
      color: #fff;
    }
  }
</style>
